  "summary": "Full assessment of all 128 Russian/Vietnamese passages and both titles. Yalta and the first meeting, the wife and ‘lower race’, the evening at the pier, the first night and Anna’s repentance, Oreanda at dawn, the parting at the station, Moscow winter and the sturgeon remark, the journey to S. and the grey fence, the theatre, the hotel meetings, the two lives, the mirror and the open ending are complete and in order. One major finding (a Vietnamese áo dài for a grey dress) and twenty-four minor ones from the separate-context pass were revised; the вы/ты shifts are carried by Vietnamese address. Fidelity, voice and imagery are 9.0, mechanics 9.5, naturalness 8.5. Unrounded weighted score 8.975 meets the unchanged 8.6 threshold. No unresolved major or critical issue remains.",
  "title_review": {
    "source_title": "Дама с собачкой",
    "target_title": "Người đàn bà có con chó nhỏ",
    "rationale": "Người đàn bà có con chó nhỏ is the established Vietnamese title, matches the nickname used in the text and renders the diminutive собачка."
